Z||000012||Fformula88||01-05-2001||07:01 PM||||Ok Ray, you must have the most expensive Fiero EVER!!  I mean, $145,777.28  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> for a Fiero GT?!?!?!   I think for that much you should have at leats been able to get a Mera!  LOL, j/k.  I am sure we all know its a typo.<P>My Formula was an early 88 car, built in September 87.  The sticker on it was $13,267.00 with an auto trans, opt. package #2 (cruise, lamp grp, tilt wheel, cycle wipers, AC) ETR cassette stereo floor mats and rear defogger.  But I bought it in 1996 for $2850 with only 67K miles on it.  Body interior and frame are nearly mint.  <P>I wouldn't pay 20K for a Fiero today, but I would pay quite a bit for a low milage 88 GT.  <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">  <BR>1988 Fiero Formula||||reg||1
